{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1385024-adversaries-of-the-righteous-and-hundred-devils-night-parade","id":1385024,"title":"Adversaries of the Righteous and Hundred Devils Night Parade","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Exalted"],"posts":[{"date":"2020-05-01T00:20:28-07:00","id":1385024,"title":"Adversaries of the Righteous and Hundred Devils Night Parade","content":"According to Lunars KS update #53, <u>Adversaries of the Righteous</u> is in first draft, and <u>Hundred Devils Night Parade</u> is in redlines. Aren't these just collections of the previously released material? What remains to be written?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1856-hakkonen","name":"Hakkonen","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"159"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-05-01T00:29:21-07:00","id":1385025,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Hakkonen</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1385024-adversaries-of-the-righteous-and-hundred-devils-night-parade#post1385024\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">According to Lunars KS update #53, <u>Adversaries of the Righteous</u> is in first draft, and <u>Hundred Devils Night Parade</u> is in redlines. Aren't these just collections of the previously released material? What remains to be written?</div> </div> </div> </div>The final versions will have more entries beyond those that have been released so far. For instance, we know there should be a 3rd circle demon in the lot which was not released individually.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":5}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25285-epitome","name":"Epitome","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar25285_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"754"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-05-01T01:49:18-07:00","id":1385032,"title":"","content":"I think Hundred Devils Night Parade has a fair few more entries, and Adversaries of the Righteous is supposed to be a similar size... which means it needs a lot more, because there's like double (or more?) the entries for HDNP as there is for Adversaries.<br /> <br /> Which, I assume, is why HDNP is in Redlines while Adversaries is only on the First Draft. I also suspect they'll go through the levels quicker than normal.<br /> <br /> <br /> Hmmm... I'm looking forward to HDNP, I generally have found it better/more useful than Adversaries, although I'd like more higher-level entries (and hopefully there will be some). But I hope that Vance or one of the other mechanics writers has a look through and edits the mechanics in the Second Draft phase, because while there are lots of good entries, there are some that are thematically good, but mechanically borked.<br /> <br /> There's also the issue of their original suggestion of maybe having a discount for people who've bought pdfs. I'm sure I've spent like 60 dollars on HDNP already, I would be quite irritated to spend another 40 dollars (or whatever the prices are for these things) on a book where I already have 90% of entries.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>STing Bronze Age Exalted","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2402-the-wizard-of-oz","name":"The Wizard of Oz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2402_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10350"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-05-01T08:52:45-07:00","id":1385081,"title":"","content":"I would love to see a total collection of these. The lack of a proper beastiary has always been a problem for me with exalted so im eager to see something like this.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2107-wiwuno","name":"Wiwuno","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2107_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"122"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}